 Web\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGuest Contact Info:\r\n\r\nName: Faith Saalfelder\r\n\r\nPrimary Email: faithanncampbell@gmail.com\r\n\r\nPrimary Phone:\r\n\r\nAction Steps:\r\nPlease contact this guest as soon as possible, and update the case within 24 hours with steps taken to recover the guest. You can update the case either by replying-all to this email, or on the open cases dashboard on the Franchisee Portal.\r\n\r\nRestaurant Info:\r\n\r\nPC#: 355421-DD\r\n\r\n2005 Mount Holly Rd\r\n\r\nBurlington\r\n\r\nNJ\r\n\r\n(609)526-2481\r\n\r\nIncident Details:\r\n\r\nIncident Date: 10-08-2026\r\n\r\nIncident Hour: 01:41:50 PM EST\r\n\r\nArea of Restaurant:\r\n\r\nProduct: Tiramisu Cloud Latte\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease contact the Navigator at 877-800-2922 if you have any questions.\r\n\r\nThank you\r\n\r\nCustomer Care Coordinator\r\n\r\nCase# CCC11635772\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*\r\nThe information contained in this communication is confidential, and is intended only for the use of the recipient named above.\r\nNOTE: This communication may contain confidential information, which cannot be shared with any third parties other than your professional advisors or as may be required by law. If the reader of this message is not the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that any dissemination, distribution, or copying of this communication, or any of its contents, is strictly prohibited. If you have received this communication in error, please re-send this communication to the sender and delete the original message and any copy of it from your computer system.\r\n~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*\r\n\r\n\r\nRef:MSG9772026_nNhYeKUKLnwa6WsUnrqd','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Service','MEDIUM','MANAGER_NOTIFIED',0,0,'EXACT_STORE_NUMBER','HIGH','2026-10-11T18:10:13.000Z',NULL,replace('Thank you for bringing this matter to our attention.\n\nWe have received the complaint and are reviewing the matter with the appropriate store manage